      "content": "idk i'm just really worried about it getting nasty since the tool was so dirty. if i don't go to the doctor right now, can i just take some extra ibuprofen or maybe some leftover antibiotics i have from a sinus infection earlier this year? i just want to make sure i'm covered so i can finish this job today.",
